    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105-a5">

                <pb facs="0217" n="137" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg137"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr.
                            Sörensen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-01"><hi rendition="#italic">October 1,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Replying to yours of the 29th ultimo, I beg
                    to inform you that I have this day addressed a communication to the Danish
                    minister of foreign affairs requesting that your name be stricken off the
                    conscription rolls and that you be exempted from military duty.</p>
                <p>Your certificate of naturalization is returned herewith.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S.
                    Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
